# The tag pick list over many tags: Esc typed while the tags load stops
# after the first page, the list titled incomplete; loaded to the end,
# more tags than it holds, the first A to Z, also incomplete; the last
# chosen and appended; the pick list of the search's Tags filter.
#@ DEEP
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K CTRL-E PGDN UP F4
P ESC
S STOPPED
K ESC F4
S FULL
K END
S FULLEND
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ESC
T Y
K ESC CTRL-F PGDN UP F4
S SRCHPICK
K ENTER
S SRCHADD
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
